WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:09.926
Hey there, fella Heard you’re a gravedigger Said you buried a few famous people 

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.302
buy your drink?

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.514
Cognac Top shelf

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.517
I’m ready to go, dad

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.227
All right, Tommy Hold your pants, son

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:20.687
I want to go with you, daddy Please

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.813
 I'll bring you back something special

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.690
Maybe that gingham dress I picked out

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.190
No

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:24.816
Maybe?

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:31.281
They called themselves The Rufus Buck Gang

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:35.285
Some say that they were senseless killers

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.327
Pa please

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:40.290
Some say they were haunted by wild spirits

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.083
It’s all right son, we’re federal Marshalls

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:45.628
Their reign of terror began with the old Palmer family

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.464
Berjolene

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.383
One of the Palmers She’s gone 

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:53.386
Heck wants to find her
before something worse happens

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:56.056
Let em send their best We’re gonna take them fools out too 

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.974
And we’s gonna get this back in blood

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.519
I’m US Marshall, Heck Thomas

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:04.272
As God is my witness we will see justice done

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:08.610
I’ll trail them boys to wherever they’re holed up, then I’mma set an ambush for them

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:10.695
Go ahead and turn around for me 

00:01:10.695 --> 00:01:13.073
The great Heck Thomas

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.742
You’re gonna be remembered as a murdering coward

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:19.287
You’re gonna have to be remembered as the man who gets done in by Rufus Buck

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:23.249
Buck murdered a law man

00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:32.467
What’s so special about this Rufus?

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.886
They think that he’s destined to be a great leader

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:42.185
I’mma make you all kings of this new world 

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:45.271
Anything that y’all want is gonna be yours for the taking

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:48.483
This ends now

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.078
Well, how does it end? 

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:02.288
 Was there some big gun fight or something?

00:02:03.581 --> 00:02:05.333
Whoa, whoa, whoa Easy

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:06.709
Get your money's worth 

